summary:
  The playing station's name goes back to the raw bright green.

history:
  Five labels were written in the raw accent after a readable text variant
  already existed, the playing station's name among them. The library can
  prove a colour reads; only a look at the labels themselves can tell
  whether they use it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/MediaListItem.qml

find:
                             ? root.accentBrightText

replace:
                             ? root.accentBright

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_no_text_is_written_in_the_raw_accent.
  Line-neutral.
